<title>CANADA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM CANADIAN OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Canadian Open</p>
<p>tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>3-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Magui Serna (Spain) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Rita Grande (Italy) beat 6-Mary Pierce (France) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>8-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Sandrine Testud (France) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat 5-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
